        <history>
          <p>Nielsen's first published work, the Little Suite was composed while he was still a violin student at the Royal Danish Academy of Music. Its confident craftsmanship and warm string writing brought him immediate critical attention and remain a staple of the string-orchestra repertoire in Denmark.</p>
